<p><span style="font-size: medium;">The Jettribe Rescue Boards are rescue tow sled equipment designed to be towed by a PWC (Jet Ski) for fast rescue. They are lightweight and tough, as well as compact when not in use. The Inflatable construction with Drop=Stitch PVC material makes it much lighter than traditional rescue boards. The towable rescue sled is fast and maneuverable. The tow-behind Jetski rescue board is designed for use behind Personal Water Craft (PWC) to react quickly and arrive on time to a swimmer in trouble or a downed rider on a race course. Also, the towable rescue sled is the perfect equipment for tow-in surfing. Worldwide associations rely on the Rescue Board as their vital rescue equipment such as Peruvian National Police, Surf Rescue Division, China Closed Course PWC Racing, Yamaha of Thailand PWC Safety, and the USA IJSBA West Coast and Mid-America Closed Course Racing.</span></p>
